SUMMARY:Part Closure: WINDRUSH LINE: From 0100 Saturday 28 and all day 
 Sunday 29 November\, including Friday and Saturday Night Overground\, no 
 service between Highbury & Islington and Battersea Park / Clapham Junction
  / New Cross / New Cross Gate. Use MILDMAY LINE services between Highbury 
 & Islington\, Canonbury and Dalston Kingsland. Replacement bus services 
 operate.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261128T133701Z
UID:06ed58f7-eb20-11f1-8000-70a8a527d0f0
DTSTART:20261128
DTEND:20261130
SUMMARY:Part Closure: HAMMERSMITH & CITY LINE: Saturday 28 and Sunday 29 
 November\, no service on the entire line. There will also be no CIRCLE 
 LINE service between Hammersmith / High Street Kensington and Tower Hill 
 (via Kings Cross St Pancras). Use DISTRICT LINE services between Aldgate 
 East and Barking.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261128T133701Z
UID:06ed58f8-eb20-11f1-8000-70a8a527d0f0
DTSTART:20261128
DTEND:20261130
SUMMARY:Part Closure: ELIZABETH LINE: Saturday 28 and Sunday 29 November\, 
 no service between Maidenhead / Heathrow (all terminals) and Abbey Wood / 
 Shenfield. Use PICCADILLY LINE services between Heathrow and Central 
 London. LONDON PADDINGTON STATION will be closed on this day\, with no 
 HEATHROW EXPRESS services. GWR services will not run between Maidenhead / 
 Greenford and Paddington\, with limited long distance services to/from 
 Euston. There will also be no GREATER ANGLIA services on these days 
 between Shenfield / Southend Victoria / Southminster and Liverpool 
 Street\, use CENTRAL LINE connections between Ealing Broadway\, West Acton
  (for Acton Main Line)\, Central London\, Liverpool Street\, Stratford and
  Newbury Park. Replacement bus services operate\, not serving Iver\, 
 please use Langley instead.
END:VEVENT
